 "summary": "The Towers (Fa\u00e7ade) in real LEGO parts: the street front of the Narragansett Towers on a shallow base, at the full model's scale with the rooms behind left out. Two round granite towers under slate cones; between them the arch that carries Ocean Road, a car in its passage and another coming out; over it the great room's ribbon of sage windows under a steep dormered roof, the open belfry with its gold bell, and the chimney; beside them the stone wing with its green door. In front, the road and its crosswalk, a granite wall with a hedge of hydrangeas, two lamp posts and a tree. The back is a plain granite wall, so it sits neatly on a shelf or against a wall.",
